## Design Notes

- **One file per command** in `commands/`, each mirrored by a test file in `test/commands/`.
- **Business logic lives in `lib/`**, so commands stay thin and are easy to test.
- **Dependency injection** (the `deps` argument) avoids touching the real filesystem in unit tests.
- **`test/helpers/run-cli.js`** supports a few end-to-end tests that spawn the real binary.
- **Built-in `node:test`** means no test framework dependency. Swap in Jest or Vitest if you prefer, and adjust the `test` script.
- **`files` in `package.json`** keeps tests and fixtures out of the published package.

