- **`bin/`** stays thin — all logic lives in `src/commands/` so tests can import commands directly without spawning a process.
- **`tests/cli.test.js`** covers the end-to-end path (exit codes, stderr) using `child_process.execSync`.
- Swap Jest for `node --test` or Vitest if you want zero dependencies.

