## Key files

**`package.json`**

```json
{
  "name": "tally",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "A tiny CLI for tallying things",
  "type": "module",
  "bin": { "tally": "bin/tally.js" },
  "main": "src/index.js",
  "exports": "./src/index.js",
  "files": ["bin", "src"],
  "engines": { "node": ">=18" },
  "scripts": {
    "tally": "node bin/tally.js",
